# The lanok skill's one home is skills/lanok/; this is where ./skills.sh
# installs it, and a clean replace wipes it, so the installed copy is ignored.
# Only that copy: maintainer skills under .claude/skills/ are committed, and
# skills.sh removes nothing but its own directory.
.claude/skills/lanok/
